      "derivedFrom": "018-oversize-opustags",
      "profiles": [
        "metadata",
        "full"
      ],
      "summary": "The same 49 comments as 018 in a different write order: CASSINI_FORMAT, then every other non-chunk tag, then the numbered chunks. Same 68,032-octet packet.",
      "rationale": "The control for 018 and the demonstration of the comment-order recommendation. Comments past octet 61,440: 25 in 018, 11 of them descriptors; 4 here, all numbered chunks, no descriptor.",
      "spec": [
